{"id":"666456","name":"蝴蝶虾","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/666456/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大虾","amount":"7只"}],"sub":[{"name":"秋葵","amount":"适量"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小黄彩椒","amount":"2个g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"金针菇，秋葵。","img":"images/666456/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"金针菇洗净，并切去根部。","img":"images/666456/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"秋葵取中间段，去除内瓤待用。","img":"images/666456/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将金针姑穿入秋葵中。","img":"images/666456/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大虾去除虾线，中间切开留虾尾。","img":"images/666456/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将菜品摆入盘中，大虾逐个竖起来摆好。","img":"images/666456/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"刚打开的郫县豆瓣酱。","img":"images/666456/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"入锅蒸至8分钟。","img":"images/666456/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间不宜过长。","img":"images/666456/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出即可，蔬菜与大虾搭配不仅颜值高，而且营养美味。","img":"images/666456/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"来个侧照，漂亮的宴客菜肴。","img":"images/666456/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}